{"document_id": "original", "page_number": 4, "section_id": "SEC003", "section_title": "发展紧密相连。", "paragraph_id": "original__docling__p4_048", "block_type": "paragraph", "text": "本政策旨在为翰森制药的长期可持续发展提供坚实人才保障， 通过双通道职业发 展体系实现人才多元化成长，通过终身学习机制激发组织创新活力，最终形成人 才与企业共同成长的良性生态。翰森制药将以此政策为指导，持续打造业内领先 的雇主品牌，为 ' 致力于成为全球领先的创新驱动型制药企业 ' 的愿景提供强而 有力的人才支撑。", "bbox": {"l": 90.024, "t": 328.9939829101563, "r": 505.42, "b": 200.8498959536346, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "bbox_coordinate_system": "docling_provenance", "source_parser": "docling", "source_id": "#/texts/43", "source_label": "text", "parent_ref": "#/body", "inside_picture": false, "table_rows": [], "is_auxiliary": false, "include_in_text_score": true, "hybrid_block_id": "#/texts/43", "source_order": 48, "is_toc": false, "include_in_text_output": true, "page_is_toc": false}
